<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TechCompanion — AI-powered setup guide generator</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: #0f1115;
    color: #e6e8eb;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .card {
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    background: #171a21;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e37;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 40px;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .tag { color: #9aa4b2; margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .status {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    background: #2a2e37;
    color: #6fc7ff;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  p.note { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #9aa4b2; line-height: 1.5; }
  .links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 24px 0; }
  a.btn {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }
  a.btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  a.primary { background: #6fc7ff; color: #171a21; }
  footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #6b7280; }
  footer a { color: #9aa4b2; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <span class="status">Demo build</span>
    <h1>TechCompanion</h1>
    <p class="tag">AI-powered setup guide generator · React + Capacitor</p>

    <div class="links">
      <a class="primary btn" href="demo/techcompanion-demo_1.html">Open Demo</a>
    </div>

    <p class="note">
      A cross-platform mobile app for device setup, barcode scanning, and AI-generated
      setup guides — built with React, Capacitor, ML Kit barcode scanning, and a
      Cloudflare Worker API proxy.
    </p>

    <footer>
      Built by Lee — Leicester, UK · <a href="https://github.com/perfecthost-ship-it/techcompanion-v5.3">View source on GitHub</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
